  "description": "Amflow UE. A fresh way to explore urban living. Light, powerful, and smart, this city e-bike fits your lifestyle. Every delightful journey, now within reach.\n\nAmflow UE is a light, powerful, and smart city e-bike designed for effortless urban rides, bringing comfort, freedom, and everyday joy within reach.\n\nMinimal Look, Modern Style\n\nEnjoy effortless urban rides. At just 46lb , the bike pairs a sleek full-carbon frame with upright, easy step-through comfort.\n\nSmooth Rides, Reduced Fatigue\n\nBuilt to cushion your ride. A suspension fork, an adjustable suspension dropper post, and wide tires absorb road chatter, turning your trip into enjoyment.\n\nPure Power, Pure Flow\n\nFeel the surge of up to 125N·m torque . With 45dBA operation and Automatic Shifting, enjoy pure immersive rides.\n\nMore Miles, Less Worries\n\nThe 600Wh removable battery delivers up to 82mi range and charges fully in 2h 23m . Set custom charge limits to extend battery health.\n\nSmart Tech, Effortless Joy\n\nRide smarter. Pair your Apple Watch to unlock automatically, enable Smart Heart Rate Control, and sync your ride data in real time.\n\nBetter Gear, Better Rides\n\nEnjoy smart lighting, snap your phone onto the mount for wireless charging, and pair an action camera to capture your highlights.\n\nEffective Protection, Enhanced Security\n\nProtect your bike with a frame lock, Apple Find My connection , movement alarms , Lost mode , and a weather-resistant build.\n\nOne Bike, Infinite Possibilities\n\nExpand with a MIK HD-compatible rear rack (27kg max load), a front rack (20kg max load), and bike bags . Ideal for daily errands or long trips.",
